# store screenshot harness output. Anchored: an unanchored `screenshots/` also swallows
# `e2e/flows/screenshots/`, the flow set itself. (The fixture database is committed now —
# `scripts/sanitize-db-fixture.ts` strips a real backup down to what may be published.)
/screenshots/

